        <mxCell id="dbnote" value="&lt;b&gt;Two databases, one per service.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;z-event keeps its tables in the service&#x27;s own database, in a schema of their own. The event must commit in the &lt;b&gt;same transaction&lt;/b&gt; as the business change, and a transaction cannot span two databases." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="915" y="595" width="200" height="225" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
